<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 111.64 mln rand SAfrica bonds Thurs.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 111.64 mln rand SAfrica bonds Thurs.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 111.64 million rand worth of South African bonds on Thursday after buying a net 244.28 million on Wednesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
